  "prose": " Exit: Close the position (stop) if close falls below sma_50, or if a close drops more than 2x atr_14 (~133.7 points) from the entry price, or if rsi_14 crosses above 70 and then rolls back below it, signalling momentum exhaustion; also exit on close below sma_20 if a tighter, trend-following stop is preferred.",
